// Lower median of the winning labeled hammings.
// Even counts keep the smaller of the two central values.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hmed ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hmed rank

IMPULSE hmed 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hmed" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
